# Backend (FastAPI) Conventions

- Organize the backend with a clear entrypoint (e.g., `app/main.py`) and separate service modules (e.g., `vault_processor.py`).
- When handling uploads:
  - Accept vault zips via multipart form-data.
  - Extract them into per-request temp directories.
  - Clean up temp directories after processing is complete.
- For markdown processing:
  - Use libraries (`markdown-it-py`, `PyYAML`, `spaCy`) instead of ad-hoc regex where feasible.
- For LLM calls via OpenRouter:
  - Read API keys from environment variables, never from code.
  - Implement retries and timeouts so one failed call does not hang the whole job.
  - Log only metadata (file counts, durations), never raw note content.

